tra daring adventurer, you can unlock speedrun challenges where you can build up incredible speed for a true test of your reflexes and temple-running prowess.[/p]<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589940/extras/72d3bfdc4e1b886abe59911e9d7b9e57.poster.avif?t=1755248983\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589940/extras/72d3bfdc4e1b886abe59911e9d7b9e57.webm?t=1755248983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589940/extras/72d3bfdc4e1b886abe59911e9d7b9e57.mp4?t=1755248983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589940/extras/06330fe889bf033b166bd09c358fd92b.webp?t=1755248983\" width=616 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>This VR game requires a play area of at least 2m x 2m with 360° tracking.</li><li>You may get a sensation of almost losing your balance when blocks you stand on start or stop moving. This will usually quickly decrease over time. The game also has a variety of VR comfort options.</li><li>There is a small risk of actually losing your balance and falling over. Play at your own risk.</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Good luck on your adventure!</p>",
